### Testing

The {{ name }} has been extensively tested automatically with [axe-core](https://github.com/dequelabs/axe-core) and manually with the most popular screen readers.

### Screen Readers

The {{ name }} has been tested with the following screen readers and browsers combinations:

| Environment | Tool |
| --- | --- |
| Firefox | NVDA |
| Chrome | JAWS |
| Microsoft Edge | JAWS |

